msgid "**Once per host:** The first compose stack of a play decides for the whole host. The assets are installed when any application of ``CURRENT_PLAY_APPLICATIONS`` resolves ``lookup('ca_injected', ...)`` true; either way the run-once flag is set, so later stacks skip the role."
msgstr ""

# not defined`` フラグを経由して書き込む ``tasks/utils/once/flag.yml``,
