msgid "**RBAC through ACL roles:** every deploy creates the ACL roles ``admin``, ``user-manager`` and ``self-service`` under ``ou=aclroles`` and assigns them on the base DN to the matching RBAC groups ``web-app-fusiondirectory-administrator``, ``-user-manager`` and ``-self-service`` in the roles OU. FusionDirectory resolves the ``member`` attribute of these ``groupOfNames`` entries. The platform administrator persona keeps its direct ``admin`` grant."
