msgid "**Role mapping:** PluggableAuth's `mapped` group sync sets the wiki groups from the `groups` claim at every OIDC login: `administrator` grants `sysop`, `bureaucrat` and `interface-admin`; the `bureaucrat` and `interface-admin` roles grant their namesake group alone. A user who leaves a role group loses the wiki group at the next login."
