msgid "**Switching from compose.** Before MDAD runs, [carry_over_compose_data.sh](./files/flavor/ansible/carry_over_compose_data.sh) copies the compose flavor's signing key and media store from the `synapse_data` volume into `matrix_mdad_matrix`, at the paths `vars.yml.j2` pins for MDAD (`matrix_synapse_config_dir_path`, `matrix_synapse_media_store_path`), owned by `MATRIX_SYNAPSE_UID`/`MATRIX_SYNAPSE_GID`. Each item is copied only into an empty target; a key or media MDAD already holds is kept, and the compose volume is left untouched. The task prints one `SKIPPED`, `KEPT` or `COPIED` line per item; the signing key lines name the key ids."
