msgid "Add a post-deploy assert that the GPU actually reached the container, once `feature/store-i18n` is merged. The role already selects the path by itself: `services.s1.gpu` states the intent and `S1_GPU` ANDs it with `lookup('gpu')`, so a host `sys-svc-container` does not count as a GPU host builds the CPU image whatever the flag says. What is missing is the check that the device arrived, in the shape of `web-svc-libretranslate/tasks/utils/assert_gpu.yml`: ask the served container how many CUDA devices it counts rather than trusting the two stats. The `runtime: nvidia` line itself comes from `sys-svc-container/templates/resource.yml.j2` on that branch. Upstream measures `Router(preload=True)` at 32.8 ms on GPU against 193 to 464 ms on CPU."
