msgid "An expression combines ids with ``AND`` and ``OR``. ``AND`` means every licence applies at once, so the strictest wins: grants intersect, duties and disclaimers union. ``OR`` means the licensee picks one whole licence, so the alternative with the most favourable context wins and its own row is used. Folding ``OR`` field by field would invent a licence nobody offers: Redis under ``AGPL-3.0-only OR RSALv2 OR SSPL-1.0`` would come out carrying no duty at all, because no single duty is common to all three."
