# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the SSH client packages required to enable secure remote access and key-based authentication on Linux systems. It ensures that the appropriate SSH client is installed depending on the target distribution and that the installation is executed only once."
msgstr "このロールは、Linuxシステム上の安全なリモートアクセスとキーベースの認証を有効にするために必要なSSHクライアントパッケージをインストールします。 ターゲット分布に応じて、適切なSSHクライアントがインストールされ、インストールが一度だけ実行されることを確認します。."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "このロールはインストールします [python-pip ディレクティブ](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) ターゲットシステムのパッケージ。 Pythonパッケージをインストールするためにpipパッケージマネージャが利用可能であることを保証します。."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from `/etc/sudoers.d`."
msgstr "このロールはインストールします [ログイン](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) デフォルト sudoers ファイルをパッケージ化して、ターゲット システムに安全で一貫性のある特権エスカレーションを確保します。 これは、最高の慣行に従う事前構成されたsudoersファイルを使用し、からドロップインファイルを読み込むためのディレクティブを含みます `/etc/sudoers.d`お問い合わせ."

msgid "This role installs the ``app-control`` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy ``web-app-semaphore``, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. ``sys-svc-compose`` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in ``sys-front-inj-all`` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the ``baudolo`` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, which they include conditionally once ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` is in ``group_names``. The first seed of a play reads ``databases.csv`` once through ``tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml``; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips ``baudolo-seed``, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. ``baudolo-seed`` gets the password on stdin (``--password-stdin``), so it never shows in the host’s process list."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `app-control` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy `web-app-semaphore`, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. `sys-svc-compose` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in `sys-front-inj-all` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `baudolo` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, which they include conditionally once `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is in `group_names`. The first seed of a play reads `databases.csv` once through `tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml`; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips `baudolo-seed`, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. `baudolo-seed` gets the password on stdin (`--password-stdin`), so it never shows in the host's process list."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "このロールはインストールします `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ ターゲットシステムのパッケージ。 Pythonパッケージをインストールするためにpipパッケージマネージャが利用可能であることを保証します。."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "このロールはインストールします `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ デフォルト sudoers ファイルをパッケージ化して、ターゲット システムに安全で一貫性のある特権エスカレーションを確保します。 これは、最高の慣行に従う事前構成されたsudoersファイルを使用し、からドロップインファイルを読み込むためのディレクティブを含みます ``/etc/sudoers.d``お問い合わせ."

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/), up to `SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES`. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__, up to ``SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES``. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "このロールは、Ansible グループ内のすべてのホストに、NFS クライアントパッケージを蒸留所にインストールします。 ``svc-swarm-node`` プローブマウントの設定 ``storage.nfs.server`` そして輸出基盤から svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml デプロイ時のリーダビリティと分散性を確認するSPOT。 実際のドッカーの容積の台紙は容器の開始のドッカー エンジンによって運転される後で起こります。."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "このロールは、Ansible グループ内のすべてのホストに、NFS クライアントパッケージを蒸留所にインストールします。 `svc-swarm-node` プローブマウントの設定 `storage.nfs.server` そして輸出基盤から svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml デプロイ時のリーダビリティと分散性を確認するSPOT。 実際のドッカーの容積の台紙は容器の開始のドッカー エンジンによって運転される後で起こります。."

