msgid "[x] A shared Playwright helper, `probeForgedIdentity` in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/utils/forged-identity.js`, forges every trusted header (`X-Forwarded-User`, `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, `X-Forwarded-Email`, `X-Forwarded-Groups`, `Remote-User`, `Remote-Email`, `X-Remote-User`, `X-Auth-Request-*`) against `/`, `/healthz/ready`, each ACL exception path and each API path of a vhost. It asserts that no session cookie is set and that no logged-in page is served. `roles/web-app-postmarks/files/playwright/test-oidc-security.js` is the model. (`forged-identity.js:29-43` lists the forged headers, `:92-105` the probed paths, the role's own plus the `/healthz/*` locations when the prometheus integration adds them, and `:114-144` returns the first hop of each probe with its `Set-Cookie` names and body, failing when `/healthz/ready` answers 500 or above. Each role's `test-forged-identity.js` asserts on that result, for example `roles/web-app-n8n/files/playwright/test-forged-identity.js:20-53`. `tests/lint/ansible/roles/test_header_trust_forged_identity_spec.py::test_the_helper_forges_every_trusted_header` fails when the helper drops a header of `DETECTED_HEADERS`.)"
