msgstr "```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ pins ``sso.enabled``, ``logout.enabled`` and ``redis.enabled`` to ``false``; the upstream image is a client-side QR generator with no accounts and no server-side session. There is nothing for the ``biber`` or ``administrator`` persona to log in to, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` ペルソナとベースラインのリーダビリティアサーションは無条件に実行されます。."

