msgid "`auth_subject: user` or `auth: oidc` requires a `delegation` block; see [delegation.md](mcp/delegation.md)."
msgstr "`auth_subject: user` または `auth: oidc` お問い合わせ `delegation` ブロック; 参照 [delegation.md](mcp/delegation.md)お問い合わせ."

