msgid "🛂 **Superuser reconcile:** [`files/python/reconcile_superusers.py`](./files/python/reconcile_superusers.py) grants `is_superuser` and `is_staff` to each Taiga account whose username or email matches a member of the `administrator` role group and removes both from every other account, except the bootstrap superuser and Taiga system accounts. It runs as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer (`tasks/03_rbac.yml`). This is the role mapping of the LDAP login path, which maps no group itself."
msgstr ""

